# A file tree beside a pull request's diff: an open folder holds its files in a group under its own row. The ring took in the folder with every file in it, ArrowDown went from there to the diff, and ArrowUp from a file went past every folder above it, out of the tree. The arrows now step row by row, down and back up, and a folder closed with Enter is stepped past.
pages/file-tree.html
start:css=#filter
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=#app
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=#services
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=#harvest
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=#weather
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=#models
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=#tree
key:ArrowUp
expect:css=#models
key:ArrowUp
expect:css=#weather
key:ArrowUp
expect:css=#harvest
key:ArrowUp
expect:css=#services
key:ArrowUp
expect:css=#app
key:ArrowUp
expect:css=#filter
# Closed, a folder is its row alone.
key:ArrowDown
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=#services
key:Enter
wait:200
key:ArrowDown
expect:css=#models
